{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36309","headline":"献浙东王大夫二首 二 · 方干","name":"献浙东王大夫二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王臣夷夏仰清名，领镇犹爲失意行。\n已见玉璜曾上钓，何愁金鼎不和羹。\n誉将星月同时朽，身应山河满数生。\n泥滓云霄至悬阔，渔翁不合见公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}